@prefix scheme:  <https://example.org/waka/scheme/> .

# Full batch conversion of idiig/wlsph's wlsph-full.json (all 1000
# categories) -- see scripts/build_concepts.py's module docstring and
# design-notes.md's "概念层数据源" section for source notes, known data
# quirks, and the URI convention (also used by concept-example.ttl's
# hand-picked subset, which this file supersedes for coverage purposes
# but does not replace -- see design-notes.md).
#
# Generated 2058 skos:Concept instances (1000 leaf/synonymy-
# level concepts referenced by lex-batch.ttl's ontolex:reference, plus
# their ancestor pos/group/field/near_synonymy concepts).

